{"hw":"βιώσκομαι","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">βιώσκομαι</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">βι-ώσκομαι</span>, causal of <span class=\"gk\">βιόω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">quicken, make</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">keep alive</b>, once in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span> in <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">σὺ γάρ μ' ἐβιώσαο, κούρη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.468</span> </span>; cf. <span class=\"gk\">βιόσσαο</span>: the <span class=\"lex-gram\">pres.</span> occurs in the compd. <span class=\"gk\">ἀναβιώσκομαι</span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> later in pass. sensc, <b class=\"lex-tr\">rcvive</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ἕτεροι τόποι βιώσκονται</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mete.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">351a35</span> </span>; simply, <b class=\"lex-tr\">live</b>, <span class=\"gk\">βιωσαμένῳ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.2100</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">βιώσκεσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ind.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9</span> </span>.</div></div>"}